OL,3,GNEWSAMagheralin: Road reopens following
OL,4,Asuspected chemical alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FA County Down road has reopened
OL,7,Ffollowing a suspected chemical leak.
OL,9,FResidents in Magheralin had been
OL,10,Fadvised to keep their windows and doors
OL,11,Fclosed during the alert on Tuesday.
OL,13,FThree fire appliances were sent to the
OL,14,Fscene on the Steps Road in the village
OL,15,Fat 13:45 BST but have since left.
OL,17,FEarlier the Northern Ireland Fire and
OL,18,FRescue Service (NIFRS) said it was
OL,19,Fdealing with a "hazardous incident
OL,20,Finvolving gas" and advised people to
OL,21,Favoid the area.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
